 "remarks": "Welcome to Indian River Green! Located in a private community of 20 townhouses, do not miss this sophisticated furnished long term rental home. Beautifully appointed and renovated, this 2 bedroom end unit is situated in the most private location within the complex. The open concept design features a bright foyer with coat closet and half bath with laundry. The custom kitchen features bright white cabinetry and is complemented with Carrara marble countertops and quality stainless steel appliances. Natural light shines thru the large windows, skylights and vaulted ceiling. The dining room is situated between the kitchen and living room with fireplace and a sliding door to your very own private flagstone patio. Walk up the staircase to the primary bedroom with a wonderful upper balcony/deck, a walk-in closet and gorgeous bath with Calcutta marble double vanity, soaking tub, Jerusalem limestone flooring, chrome lighting and shower. The second ensuite bedroom has a vaulted ceiling and bonus loft space and features a bath with Brazilian IPE and slate tile finishes, integrated LED lighted mirror/cabinet and 5\" white oak flooring. Just a walk to Westport train station and a bike ride to the heart of downtown shopping and beaches. Easy access to I95. Enjoy the Westport lifestyle!",
